msgid "TOME@Gun@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Ingenuity"

msgid "TOME@Gun@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Bring forth the industrious power of the old Commonwealth, fit your units in "
"armor strong enough to reflect {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and "
"utilize the full power of a new evolving {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@AUTHOR@NAME"
msgstr "Emperor Nasir the Sucessor"

msgid "TOME@Gun@AUTHOR@DESC"
msgstr "\"Three things make this Empire great: faith, steel and magelocks.\""

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit1"
msgstr "Magelock Gunners"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit2"
msgstr "Line Infantry"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT.Hyperlink} that uses the new issued "
"Magelock rifle, given time, this unit will be a force to be reckoned with."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit@Skill"
msgstr "Deploy Field Cannon"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"This unit's deals +20% extra damage and inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DEMORALIZED.Hyperlink} due to adjacent units with Volley Fire."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"At the start of battle, summon an {GLOBAL.UNITS.OBSERVER.Hyperlink}, a "
"construct that inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MARKED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit@Skill2"
msgstr "Volley Fire"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill1@Unit"
msgstr "Combat Engineer"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill2@Name"
msgstr "[Mine/] Forge Industry"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill2@SKILL@Name"
msgstr "Observation Unit"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+15 "
"{GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} if Adjacent to another Forge Industry. "
"[bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per Adjacent "
"{GLOBAL.QuarryConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.MineConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill3@Name"
msgstr "Reactive Alloys"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill3@Skill@Name"
msgstr ""
"Deploy a new advanced type of armor for your troops, only made possible by "
"your people's ingenuity: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Reflects 3 {GLOBAL."
"PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink} on each melee attack. [bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL."
"DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill3@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Unique type of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT.Hyperlink} that may deploy "
"constructs until the end of the battle."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill3@Desc"
msgstr ""
"Deploy a construct that deals ranged {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill2@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr "Combat Engineer"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill4@Name"
msgstr "Off-field Barrage"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill4@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Deploy a low damaging barrage for 3 {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}. Each "
"turn 2 random units are hit and suffer: [bulletlist] [bullet/]1 {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.SUNDERED_DEFENSE.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]-3 {GLOBAL."
"UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill5@Name"
msgstr "Deploy Bayonets"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill5@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Order all your {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT.Hyperlink} to deploy their "
"Melee Weapons and charge, for 1 turn: [bulletlist][bullet/]Regains 100% of "
"their <<m:{GLOBAL.ActionPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>. [bullet/]Gain a {GLOBAL."
"ChargeConcept.Hyperlink} attack that deals more damage based on target's "
"lost {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Disable all {GLOBAL."
"RangedConcept.Hyperlink} abilities for 1 turn."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill6@Name"
msgstr "This unit is at maximun firepower."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill6@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Standardize a new special Ammunition for your troops: [bulletlist] "
"[bullet/]Add {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.EXPLOSIVE_AMMO.Hyperlink} to all {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill6@Group"
msgstr "Steel and Magelock Group"

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill7@DESC"
msgstr "Fire a salvo of explosive ammunition."

msgid "TOME@Gun@Skill7@Name"
msgstr "Explosive Ammunition"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME"
msgstr "Ascension: Iron Marshal OLD"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME2"
msgstr "Charge!!"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME3"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain a {GLOBAL.ChargeConcept.Hyperlink} attack that "
"deals more damage based on target's lost {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]Disable all {GLOBAL.RangedConcept.Hyperlink} abilities for 1 turn."

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME4"
msgstr "Bayonet Charge"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME5"
msgstr ""
"Deal melee damage based on target lost {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME6"
msgstr "Bayonets Deployed"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME22"
msgstr "Field Cannon"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME33"
msgstr ""
"Deals damage in a 2-hex line. Removes {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink} "
"and {GLOBAL.RetaliationConcept.Hyperlink} on hit."

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME44"
msgstr "Field Repairs"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME55"
msgstr ""
"Heal target unit for 15 {GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}, doubled "
"if the unit is a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.CONSTRUCT.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@GUNNEW@PANTHEON@NAME55"
msgstr "Ascension: Iron Marshal"
